en.fuller:
συν-ίστημι
[in LXX for צָוָה pi., קָהַל ni., etc.; 1Ma.12:43, 2Ma.4:24, 3Ma.1:19 (and frequently in these books) ;]
__1. trans.,
__(a) to commend, recommend: with accusative of person(s), 2Co.3:1 6:4 10:12 10:18; id. with dative, Rom.16:1 (as frequently at the beginning of a letter; Deiss., LAE, 226), 2Co.5:12; before πρός, 2Co.4:2; pass., before ὑπό, 2Co.12:11;
__(b) to show, prove, establish: with accusative, Rom.3:5 5:8, 2Co.6:4; dupl. accusative, Gal.2:13; accusative and inf., 2Co.7:11
__2. Intrans., pf., συνέστηκα (as also 2 aor. and plpf.);
__(a) to stand with or near: Luk.9:32;
__(b) to be composed of, consist, cohere: Col.1:17 (see Lft., in l), 2Pe.3:5.†
(AS)

es.fuller:
συν-ίστημι
[en LXX for צָוָה pi., קָהַל ni., etc.; 1Mac.12:43, 2Mac.4:24, 3Mac.1:19 (and frec. in these books) ;]
1. trans.,
(a) to commend, recommend: con acus. de pers., 2Co.3:1 6:4 10:12 10:18; id. con dat., Ro.16:1 (as frec. at the beginning of a letter; Deiss., LAE, 226), 2Co.5:12; before πρός, 2Co.4:2; pas., before ὑπό, 2Co.12:11;
(b) to show, prove, establish: con acus., Ro.3:5 5:8, 2Co.6:4; dupl. acus., Gá.2:13; acus. and inf., 2Co.7:11
2. Intrans., pf., συνέστηκα (as also 2 aor. and plpf.);
(a) to stand with or near: Lc.9:32;
(b) to be composed of, consist, cohere: Col.1:17 (see Lft., in l), 2P.3:5.†
(AS)

he.fuller:
συν-ίστημι
[בשבעים for צָוָה פיעל, קָהַל ni., ועוד; 1מק.12:43, 2מק.4:24, 3מק.1:19 (and לעיתים קרובות in these books) ;]
1. trans.,
(a) to commend, recommend: עם ישי׳ של אדם, 2קור.3:1 6:4 10:12 10:18; id. עם עקיף, רומים.16:1 (as לעיתים קרובות at the beginning of a letter; Deiss., LAE, 226), 2קור.5:12; before πρός, 2קור.4:2; סביל, before ὑπό, 2קור.12:11;
(b) to show, prove, establish: עם ישי׳, רומים.3:5 5:8, 2קור.6:4; dupl. ישי׳, גל.2:13; ישי׳ and מקור, 2קור.7:11
2. Intrans., pf., συνέστηκα (as also 2 עבר and plpf.);
(a) to stand with or near: לוקס.9:32;
(b) to be composed of, consist, cohere: קל.1:17 (see Lft., in l), 2פ.3:5.†
(AS)

en.fuller:
σφραγίζω
[in LXX chiefly for חָתַם (Deu.32:34, al.), also for סָתַם (Da TH Dan.8:26) ;]
to seal,
__(a) for security: Mat.27:66, Rev.20:3; τ. καρπὸν τοῦτον, figuratively (cf. Deiss., BS, 238 f.; MM, xxiv; DB, iv, 427a), Rom.15:28;
__(b) for concealment, hence, metaphorically, to hide (Da TH Dan.9:24, Jhn.14:17): Rev.10:4 22:10;
__(with) for distinction, Rev.7:3-8; metaphorically, Eph.4:30; mid., 2Co.1:22;
__(d) for authentication (Est.8:8): Jhn.3:33 6:27 (cf. κατα-σφραγίζω).†
(AS)

he.fuller:
σφραγίζω
[בשבעים בעיקר for חָתַם (דב.32:34, ועוד), also for סָתַם (Da TH דנ.8:26) ;]
to seal,
(a) for security: מתי.27:66, התג.20:3; τ. καρπὸν τοῦτον, figuratively (השוו Deiss., BS, 238 f.; MM, xxiv; DB, iv, 427a), רומים.15:28;
(b) for concealment, hence, בהשאלה, to hide (Da TH דנ.9:24, יוחנן.14:17): התג.10:4 22:10;
(with) for distinction, התג.7:3-8; בהשאלה, אפ.4:30; בינוני, 2קור.1:22;
(d) for authentication (אס.8:8): יוחנן.3:33 6:27 (השוו κατα-σφραγίζω).†
(AS)

